le=\"background-color: #ff3300; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.50<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">April 03, 2012<br/>Spring Patch 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20171016183949&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_s_Nest_Hatched_b42e02.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a dragon's nest.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">The young dragons have just hatched.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Inside Dragon Lairs all around <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia\">Tibia</a> during the event <a href=\"#/quest/spring-into-life\">Spring into Life</a>. Can also be found on <a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos\">Krailos</a>.<br/><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Dragon's Nest and Dragon's Nest (Hatching) </i> </span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Some <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a> eggs have just hatched. Get out of there!<br/><br/>Part of the <a href=\"#/quest/krailos-quest\">Krailos Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Dragon's Nest</li><li>Dragon's Nest (Hatching)</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/krailos-quest\">Krailos Quest</a></li><li>Living and Dead</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["krailos-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"krailos-quest","quest":"Krailos Quest","step":"2-6","n":25,"title":"Recolher Dragon Egg Shells","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33690,"y":31782,"z":6,"label":"Ninho de dragão chocado"}]}]}}